# Every file the corpus gate reads, by SHA-256, relative to CORPUS_ROOT.
#
# This is the whole reason the worksheets themselves need not be committed: a
# corpus fetched by scripts/fetch-corpora.sh is provably the one the baselines
# in tests/corpus/ were recorded against, and a corpus that drifted upstream
# says so rather than quietly moving the numbers.
#
# Regenerate after a deliberate corpus change:
#   (cd corpora && find nomo-corpus/sm technical-mechanics-samples -type f \
#      | LC_ALL=C sort | tr '\n' '\0' | xargs -0 sha256sum)
